      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lindsborg%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Millfest, held the first Saturday in May, showcases historic sites, folk music, woodcarving, wheat and fiber art, and classic games.",
